## When in doubt

- Compliance question → re-read `docs/COMPLIANCE`. If still unclear, ask Ian before shipping copy that mentions humans, dosing, therapy, treatment.
- "Should I refactor X?" → check if X is in the open-items list above. If not, write the smallest change that solves the problem; the codebase has been polished, large refactors should be justified.
- "Why is this hook at this priority?" → check the comment immediately above the `add_action`/`add_filter`. The audit pass left rationale comments on every non-default priority and most defensive guards.
- "Is this safe to deploy?" → re-read the affected file, the PR diff, and `docs/DEPLOY`. If the change touches CSP, JSON-LD, age-gate, or anything in `inc/business.php`, do a manual smoke check after deploy — those are the highest-blast-radius surfaces.

